+    </p>
+    <ul>
+        <li><strong>Username:</strong> A handle of your choice (we encourage using a pseudonym rather than your real name or email address).</li>
+        <li><strong>Password:</strong> Used solely to verify your identity.</li>
+    </ul>
+    <p>
+        <strong>How your credentials are processed:</strong> Your username and password are sent securely (with <code>Referrer-Policy: no-referrer</code> and ambient cookies omitted) to our authentication endpoint (<code>us-central1-web-devrel-apps.cloudfunctions.net/times_cdn/api/register</code> and <code>/api/login</code>) strictly for account registration and authentication. Form interactions on Sign In and Sign Up pages are explicitly excluded from click tracking (<code>data-skip-tracking="true"</code>), and passwords are immediately cleared from application state after submission.
